{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to flag a facilities constraint on the observation wing. We inspected it this afternoon, and only bays Obs-2 through Obs-7 have functioning wall oxygen outlets — that's six bays with oxygen. Obs-1 and Obs-8 do not. Additionally, our two portable oxygen units are already committed elsewhere tomorrow, so we won't be able to supplement those two bays. Given Dr. Shah's forecast that six of the eight expected arrivals will need monitored observation, and if we're expecting respiratory illness cases, we should plan around having only six oxygen-capable bays available."}
```

